,"link_text":"","link_url":"","background":"#ffffff","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#1a1a1a","text_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}}},"block_order":["image_8P4Pz4"],"name":"Media with text","settings":{"full_width":false,"alternate_media_position":false,"spacing":"none"}},"multi_column_hWkfHX":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_MhwDgN":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hf_20260505_164314_90da2aee-a0ed-40cb-abcf-5477fa81462c.png","show_controls":false,"column_size":"3","title":"NATURE'S PERFORMANCE FIBRE","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merino is nature's performance fiber, breathable, thermoregulating, and built to move. It pulls moisture off the skin to keep you dry through every transition, while its fiber structure traps odor inside and only releases it in the wash. The result is a knit that stays fresh wear after wear, where cotton and synthetics give out.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_taxqyk":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/s-blob-v1-IMAGE-3-vpwOUd3Ac.png","show_controls":false,"column_size":"3","title":"Softer Than Cotton","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Forget what wool used to feel like. We spin ultra-fine merino into a knit that's light, smooth, and soft enough to live against the skin all day. It moves with you, returns to shape, and survives the wash without losing its form, engineered for everyday wear, not careful handling.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_rKYTRM":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/s-blob-v1-IMAGE-D-cY1lSCXxY.png","show_controls":false,"column_size":"3","title":"Pure merino Wool","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Our signature fabric, and the foundation of everything we make. This 100% ultra-fine merino wool is naturally breathable, machine-washable, and built to perform. It holds the line between comfort and durability with a clean drape and effortless f